// Title: 7Zip Compressing Dump Files
// ID: ec570e53-4c76-45a9-804d-dc3f355ff7a7
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-09-27
// Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1560.001
// Description: Detects execution of 7z in order to compress a file with a ".dmp"/".dump" extension, which could be a step in a process of dump file exfiltration.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_.dmp*" or process.command_line like "*_.dump*" or process.command_line like "*_.hdmp*")) and ((Description like "*_7-Zip*") or ((process.executable endswith "\\7z.exe" or process.executable endswith "\\7zr.exe" or process.executable endswith "\\7za.exe")) or ((process.pe.original_file_name == "7z.exe" or process.pe.original_file_name == "7za.exe" or process.pe.original_file_name == "7zr.exe"))))
